# wrangler files
.wrangler
.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
.env*
!.env.example

# tooling
node_modules
.DS_Store
*.log

# Build source maps. Vite emits these in `build.sourcemap: 'hidden'`
# mode for local debugging, but they don't get referenced from the
# shipped JS (no `//# sourceMappingURL=` comment) — and they're ~900 KB
# each, so committing them inflates every push for no shipping benefit.
*.js.map

# Note: `dist/` IS intentionally committed, and must not be ignored.
# We pre-build with `npm run build` and commit the output so Cloudflare
# Pages can deploy without a build step in the dashboard, and
# `wrangler.jsonc`'s `pages_build_output_dir` makes `dist/` the ONLY
# directory it publishes — which is what stops the live site serving
# handover.md, LEDGER.md and every Edge Function source. If we ever
# migrate to CF-managed builds, ignore the output here AND keep
# `pages_build_output_dir`: the second is what scopes the deploy.

# Deno regenerates this on every local `deno test` run; the repo has
# never pinned it and Supabase deploys don't read it.
deno.lock
